==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmq-osw|sv}} ''kviker'' or ''kvikker'', {{etyl|non|sv}} ''[[kvikr]]'' (whence also Norwegian ''[[kvik]]'' and ''[[kvikk]]'', Icelandic and Faeroese ''[[kvikur]]''), from {{etyl|gem-pro|sv}} {{recons|kwikwaz|lang=gem-pro}}, whence also English ''[[quick]]''. Ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|sv}} {{recons|gʷih₃wós||alive|lang=ine-pro}}.

